#### truecolor-80-dark
[1mtidewater[22m[90m · Tidewater Studio license and updates[39m

[90mUsage[39m  tidewater <command> [options]

[1mLicense[22m
  [1mactivate [key][22m            Add a license key (prompts; never an argument)
  [1mstatus[22m                    License, devices and offline time
  [1menroll[22m                    Get the free license, when Tidewater Studio
                            offers one
  [1mdeactivate[22m                Stop using your license on this device and free
                            its seat

[1mAccount[22m
  [1mlogin[22m                     Sign in with your account in the browser
  [1mlogout[22m                    Sign out on this device

[1mDevices[22m
  [1mregister[22m                  Register this device without a license key
  [1mdevices list[22m              List the devices using your license
  [1mdevices rename <deviceId> [label...][22m
                            Rename a device (no name clears it)
  [1mdevices deauthorize <deviceId>[22m
                            Remove a device and free its seat

[1mSettings[22m
  [1mconfig get <key>[22m          Show one setting and where its value comes from
  [1mconfig list[22m               List the settings you can see
  [1mconfig set <key> <value>[22m  Change a setting on this device
  [1mconfig reset <key>[22m        Reset a setting to its default
  [1msecret <key>[22m              Print a secret delivered to this device
  [1mmint <recipeId>[22m           Get a short-lived token from a recipe

[1mUpdates[22m
  [1mupdate check[22m              Check for a newer version
  [1mupdate apply[22m              Download and install the newer version
  [1mchangelog[22m                 Show what's new in each version

[1mContent[22m
  [1mpacks status[22m              Show installed and downloading content
  [1mpacks ensure <packIds...>[22m
                            Download and install content, with progress

[1mSupport[22m
  [1moffline-request[22m           Print the request code for offline activation
  [1mimport-bundle <file>[22m      Activate from an offline activation file
  [1mdoctor[22m                    Show what this device can do, for support
  [1mcompletion <shell>[22m        Print shell completion for bash, zsh or fish

[1mOptions[22m
  [1m--json[22m                    JSON output for scripts, on every command
  [1m--no-color[22m                Plain text (also NO_COLOR=1)
  [1m--ascii[22m                   ASCII symbols only
  [1m-h, --help[22m                Help for a command

[90mRun tidewater <command> --help for one command's options.[39m

